ue="Performer" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=none;strokeColor=#000000;fontColor=#000000;fontSize=15;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="60" y="920" width="230" height="64" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="donate" value="Donation" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=none;strokeColor=#000000;fontColor=#000000;fontSize=15;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="380" y="920" width="230" height="64" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="bank" value="BankAccount" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=none;strokeColor=#000000;fontColor=#000000;fontSize=15;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="700" y="920" width="230" height="64" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="settle" value="Settlement" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=none;strokeColor=#000000;fontColor=#000000;fontSize=15;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1020" y="920" width="230" height="64" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="ledger" value="LedgerEntry" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=none;strokeColor=#000000;fontColor=#000000;fontSize=15;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1340" y="920" width="230" height="64" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="acct" value="Account" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=none;strokeColor=#000000;fontColor=#000000;fontSize=15;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1660" y="920" width="230" height="64" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="n1" value="Reading the marks: the inner mark is the minimum, the outer the maximum. Ticket.PaymentId and LedgerEntry.PaymentId are nullable, so both take &quot;zero or one&quot; on the Payment side — a walk-in ticket paid in cash and a platform-internal journal line each exist without a gateway payment. TicketTier.ZoneId is nullable too: an online-only tier has no seating zone.
BankAccount.OwnerId is polymorphic and carries no foreign key. It holds either a MusicLounge id or a Performer id, chosen by OwnerType, so no relationship line is drawn to those two tables: the database does not enforce one." style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=none;strokeColor=#000000;fontColor=#000000;fontSize=13;shape=note;size=14;align=left;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="60" y="1030" width="1180" height="180" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="n2" value="Only core cross-domain entities appear here; the complete set of 68 is in erd-full.
Every cardinality was read off the entity class, not inferred from intent. That is how two of them were found to be wrong in the first version: both claimed &quot;exactly one&quot; against a nullable foreign key." style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=none;strokeColor=#000000;fontColor=#000000;fontSize=13;shape=note;size=14;align=left;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1290" y="1030" width="630" height="180" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="e0" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;html=1;endArrow=open;endFill=0;strokeColor=#000000;fontColor=#000000;fontSize=12;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;jumpStyle=none;" edge="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="290.0" y="172.0" as="sourcePoint"/><mxPoint x="380.0" y="172.0" as="targetPoint"/></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="e1" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;html=1;endArrow=open;endFill=0;strokeColor=#000000;fontColor=#000000;fontSize=12;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;jumpStyle=none;" edge="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="610.0" y="172.0" as="sourcePoint"/><mxPoint x="700.0" y="172.0" as="targetPoint"/></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="e2" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;html=1;endArrow=open;endFill=0;strokeColor=#000000;fontColor=#000000;fontSize=12;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;jumpStyle=none;" edge="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="175.0" y="140.0" as="sourcePoint"/><mxPoint x="815.0" y="140.0" as="targetPoint"/><Array as="points"><mxPoint x="175.0" y="118.0"/><mxPoint x="815.0" y="118.0"/></Array></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="e3" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;html=1;endArrow=open;endFill=0;strokeColor=#000000;fontColor=#000000;fontSize=12;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;jumpStyle=none;" edge="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="495.0" y="140.0" as="sourcePoint"/><mxPoint x="1135.0" y="140.0" as="